      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I oftentimes find the answers to my assignments on the World Wide Web.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I get very tired quickly because I have to do homework from both the academies and school.",
      "lang": "en"
    },
